# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Changes:
- Added Poplar, Dark Prismarine, Cinnabar and Sulfur Display Cases
- Cushions can now be placed inside every block
- Poplar Logs, Shelves and Decorated Pots can now be rotated with a Wrench
- Blockstates like Furnaces smelt progress are being better preserved when rotating with a Wrench

